@shorty_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5132

### Create a short URL (default TTL from appsettings)
POST {{shorty_backend_HostAddress}}/api/shorturls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.example.com/some/very/long/path?with=params"
}

### Create a short URL with a custom TTL (seconds, capped by MaxTtlHours)
POST {{shorty_backend_HostAddress}}/api/shorturls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.example.com/another/page",
  "ttlSeconds": 3600
}

### Resolve the short code (replace abc123 with the returned code)
GET {{shorty_backend_HostAddress}}/abc123

### Health check
GET {{shorty_backend_HostAddress}}/health
